    "chunk_text": "De Passione Domini Men \u00f0a leofestan, gehira\u00f0 nu hu drihten w\u00e6s sprecende on \u00feas tid to his geferum, & \u00dea hi \u00fea gegadorode w\u00e6ron \u00fea bisceopas & \u00fea ealdormen \u00fe\u00e6s folces in anum cafertune, & se bisceop \u00dea didon hi swi\u00fee micele \u00feeahtunge imbe urne h\u00e6lend, \u00fe\u00e6t hi hine woldon mid inwitte beswican to \u00feam \u00dea cw\u00e6don sume \u00fea men, Eala, nelle we on \u00feisne simbeld\u00e6g, \u00fei l\u00e6s wen sy \u00fe\u00e6t micel ungerec si on Mid \u00fei \u00fei h\u00e6lend w\u00e6s in Bethania lande, on Simones huse \u00fe\u00e6s untruman, \u00fea geeode him an wif to, seo \u00dea geat heo hit ofer \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes heafod be him sittendun. \u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t gesawon his gingeran, \u00fea wurdon hi swi\u00fee unrote, & hi cw\u00e6don, hw\u00e6t is \u00feeos farlorenes \u00fe\u00e6t Hw\u00e6t, heo \u00feis mahte on micel weor\u00f0 becypan & \u00feonne \u00feearfendum mannum ged\u00e6lan. \u00dea wiste hira ge\u00feancas, & cy\u00fe\u00fea to him, Hw\u00e6t is eow unea\u00f0e \u00e6t \u00feissum wife? Hw\u00e6t, heo w\u00e6s god worc wircende on me. Simble ge habba\u00f0 \u00feearfan mid eow, ac ge ne habba\u00f0 me simble. \u00de\u00e6t heo dide minum lichoman to smirenesse. And heo bicnede \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde beon on byrgenne aleged. So\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t eow secge, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feis godspell bi\u00f0 inne r\u00e6d geond ealle middangeard, bi\u00f0 hire gemindwur\u00feig \u00dea eode an of",
